---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Inquiry Privacy" description="How Wellridge handles the information you share in a service inquiry.">
  <section class="py-20"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6 text-gray-700">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-deep">Your service inquiry</h1>
    <p>When you choose Send inquiry, FormSubmit processes the details you enter and forwards them to Wellridge Group by email. We use your name, reply email, organization, selected service, public links, deadline, and message to assess fit and respond.</p>
    <p>Use public business information only. Please do not include attachments, passwords, personal or health records, or procurement-sensitive information. If an engagement requires other materials, we agree on the appropriate handoff separately.</p>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-deep">The email alternative</h2>
    <p>Prepare email instead assembles your entered details in your browser. Open email draft passes them to your email application, where you decide whether to send. Form details are not saved in browser storage by this site.</p>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-deep">Questions and requests</h2>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@wellridgegroup.com" class="text-ridge-blue underline">hello@wellridgegroup.com</a> with questions about your inquiry or to request correction or deletion of information you shared.</p>
    <p class="text-sm">Updated September 9, 2026.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
